# Species-specific Working Habits & Traits
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-1 = Restrained and strictly observes clan discipline on shift.
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-2 = Accustomed to extreme heat and keeps calm under heavy workloads.
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-3 = Adheres to a warrior's word of honor and is straightforward in reports.
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-4 = Regularly cleans and calibrates personal tools and equipment.
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-5 = Prefers working near hot power cores or smelting furnaces.
ashfall-lore-personality-unathi-6 = Dislikes idle chatter during critical operations.

ashfall-lore-personality-luam-1 = Attentive to minute details, prefers quiet night shifts.
ashfall-lore-personality-luam-2 = Possesses fine motor control when handling delicate instruments.
ashfall-lore-personality-luam-3 = Sensitive to sudden changes in lighting and background noise.
ashfall-lore-personality-luam-4 = Passionate about botany, hydroponics, and organic textiles.
ashfall-lore-personality-luam-5 = Keeps neat, illustrated diagrams in the daily work journal.
ashfall-lore-personality-luam-6 = Takes great care when handling fragile optical devices and glassware.

ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-1 = Calm and at home in narrow maintenance conduits and shafts.
ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-2 = Keeps several tasks going at once without losing track.
ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-3 = Prefers working in dimly lit crawlspaces and cable chases.
ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-4 = Judges at a glance whether a joint will hold a load.
ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-5 = Detects subtle machinery vibrations long before a failure occurs.
ashfall-lore-personality-arachnid-6 = Acts methodically, always reinforcing assembly joints with silk cords.

ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-1 = Possesses quick reflexes and creative problem-solving skills.
ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-2 = Intolerant of ambient noise, works exceptionally fast on solo shifts.
ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-3 = Has sharp hearing and navigates effortlessly in emergency lighting.
ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-4 = Proud of independent standing and fiercely guards pride reputation.
ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-5 = Switches swiftly between tasks and reacts instantly to alarm sirens.
ashfall-lore-personality-veiru-6 = Prefers mobile field work over desk-bound clerical posts.

ashfall-lore-personality-human-1 = Pragmatic and focused on meeting contractual quotas on time.
ashfall-lore-personality-human-2 = Easily establishes rapport with representatives of any species or guild.
ashfall-lore-personality-human-3 = Driven by career advancement within corporate hierarchies.
ashfall-lore-personality-human-4 = Readily adapts to changing protocols and unpredictable environments.

# Species-specific Personal Hooks
ashfall-lore-hook-unathi-1 = Keeps a family blade that requires ritual clan blessing.
ashfall-lore-hook-unathi-2 = Sworn an oath of honor to settle a debt with an armorers' guild.
ashfall-lore-hook-unathi-3 = Searching for traces of a kin lost during the Kha-Ssar ash conflicts.
ashfall-lore-hook-unathi-4 = Planned to purchase the rights to an individual smithing mark.
ashfall-lore-hook-unathi-5 = Left owner-marked tools in a workshop that has since closed.

ashfall-lore-hook-luam-1 = Carries a bolt of rare ancestral silk inherited from a weaver mentor.
ashfall-lore-hook-luam-2 = Planned to attend the annual guild assembly in the Latrei biodomes.
ashfall-lore-hook-luam-3 = Did not get to deliver calibrated optical lenses home to family.
ashfall-lore-hook-luam-4 = Was awaiting confirmation of apprenticeship at the Latrei Weaving Academy.
ashfall-lore-hook-luam-5 = Took a sample from the family seed library and never returned it.

ashfall-lore-hook-arachnid-1 = Left an unfinished woven tapestry for the home nest cluster.
ashfall-lore-hook-arachnid-2 = Owed a mineral revenue share to the collective guild pool.
ashfall-lore-hook-arachnid-3 = Was awaiting news of a new hatching cycle in the home caverns.
ashfall-lore-hook-arachnid-4 = Cherishes a custom tool for spinning structural guide cables.
ashfall-lore-hook-arachnid-5 = Rented out the family vibration sensor and never received payment.

ashfall-lore-hook-veiru-1 = Pledged to return a prized hunt trophy to the pride elder.
ashfall-lore-hook-veiru-2 = Searching for a companion from a distant frontier patrol.
ashfall-lore-hook-veiru-3 = Dreamed of acquiring a personal scout skiff for deep exploration.
ashfall-lore-hook-veiru-4 = Had not finalized the contractual settlement with the family outpost.
ashfall-lore-hook-veiru-5 = Never received the workshop's apprentice mark after finishing training.

ashfall-lore-hook-human-1 = Paying off a long-term residential mortgage in an Earth metropolis.
ashfall-lore-hook-human-2 = Was awaiting performance review results for a lead engineer posting.
ashfall-lore-hook-human-3 = Keeps an old pre-colonization photograph of the family home.
ashfall-lore-hook-human-4 = Planned to file a patent for a modified station valve design.
ashfall-lore-hook-human-5 = Never heard back from relatives living on long-haul freight lines.

# Species-specific Cryosleep Circumstances
ashfall-lore-precryo-unathi-1 = Said the clan farewell over comms and joined the station crew in cryosleep.
ashfall-lore-precryo-unathi-2 = Awaited the relief hauler; tolerates the cold of the cryo bay better than most kin.
ashfall-lore-precryo-unathi-3 = Shut down their section's forge and put the equipment into conservation mode before freezing.

ashfall-lore-precryo-luam-1 = Lined the cocoon cryo-pod with silk from the home hive and slept alongside the crew.
ashfall-lore-precryo-luam-2 = Was the last to leave the greenhouses, dimming the lights to conservation minimum.
ashfall-lore-precryo-luam-3 = Underwent a controlled stasis cycle per the station freezing schedule.

ashfall-lore-precryo-arachnid-1 = Chose a deep-horizon chamber: sleeping inside solid rock feels safer.
ashfall-lore-precryo-arachnid-2 = Inspected and sealed every section assigned to the guild before freezing.
ashfall-lore-precryo-arachnid-3 = Took a private guild pod until work on the station resumed.

ashfall-lore-precryo-veiru-1 = Entered cryosleep with the duty group, wanting to greet the relief crew first.
ashfall-lore-precryo-veiru-2 = Stood the last watch by the cryo bays and went to sleep after the shift.
ashfall-lore-precryo-veiru-3 = Underwent conservation together with the rest of the station personnel.

ashfall-lore-precryo-human-1 = Filed for cryosleep through the corporate HR office on their last working day.
ashfall-lore-precryo-human-2 = Awaited assignment to a newly constructed manufacturing facility.
ashfall-lore-precryo-human-3 = Signed a transfer to another system and entered cryosleep pending transport.
